 " \[LongDash] ",
 "a property of a head on a graph: \"Graph\", \"Cardinality\", \"Length\", \
\"VertexDensity\", \"EdgeDensity\", \"Subgraph\", \"Faithful\" and the \
volumes; a List of properties gives an Association, All gives every property"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"cc4ae47c-c7fd-4ac9-a461-a396ee509177"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraDensity"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraDensity", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "ecbff387-1c82-462a-ae8c-f48178acf0b7"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the marginal of any shape to the vertex set with respect to the counting \
measure: a vertex, a vertex list, a density, a walk graph; the one coercion \
in the API"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"01832f03-1e0f-41cd-9663-7fef40957364"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["FindInfraRepresentative"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/FindInfraRepresentative", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "429bb973-31c3-4c35-bb88-56b3f0057834"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "one member of a head as a vertex list, read off its graph or found by its \
search; a trailing count gives a List of them, \"RandomChoice\" a random \
member"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"68c9e933-dbab-4b1b-a765-f3fed1f46daf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraMemberQ"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraMemberQ", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "975c294e-c58e-4b89-8039-2b1ca328c18d"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "whether a vertex list is a member of a head on a graph"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"e3618266-cfad-4c6d-9387-4cf14b7d0568"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Substrates and Drawing", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"0d7468f0-0f72-4970-b2ae-3be91c3f1f0f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraSubstrate"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraSubstrate", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "07d11482-3b58-4f33-a364-31abdfa6e98a"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the named example substrates at size \"Small\", \"Medium\" or \"Large\": \
the tilings, meshes and closed surfaces the other pages draw on; \
InfraSubstrate[] lists the roster"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"73b04628-16ba-45f8-afce-413ad3e4aa9e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraSubstrateHighlight"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraSubstrateHighlight", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "4f7bc67a-4e1a-41bd-872c-9d8d2e24104f"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the summed densities of a list of objects drawn on a graph, the i-th object \
in the i-th palette color; a Directive styles the objects after it"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"576d7345-89de-4291-bdbc-816a4cf96fff"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Multi-constructions", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"344c947e-af84-452c-b586-157e0c7d2f96"],

Cell["\<\
Whereas the causal graph of Euclidean constructions is causally invariant, \
the branchial graphs in infrageometry are non-trivial due to \
multi-constructions.\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"5a2e2408-28f5-4b3c-880d-24eef2c344b7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraScene"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraScene", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "65384c41-d03a-4fbe-ad5d-7c299450d74c"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "a construction stated before any graph: the objects, and hypotheses that \
construct them with inert heads or assert relations between them"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"3038910b-9d25-4200-b99e-25e67273ce3a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraStep"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraStep", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "b4c8bded-a792-49b1-996b-10cf3e293c12"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "one construction encapsulated as a step of a scene; a second argument \
labels it"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"77a897d7-4e50-47e3-a062-aca377618560"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["FindInfraScene"]], 
