  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "993b95e4-bf2f-420c-b857-ec39d5d46c07"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the intersection of all balls containing a set of points; it lives on the \
Infra Topology guide"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"74a42011-98f1-40e3-8770-f70997fc9596"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["TubeVolumes"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/TubeVolumes", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "ebcfa6f6-f85e-4a15-9db8-18342f6fc30a"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the volume profile of the tube about a core; it lives on the Riemannian \
Infrageometry guide, the tube itself is InfraTube"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"c961808b-9e83-4da6-ac96-42f2e943fa92"],

Cell["\<\
not here: the quadric as an inert head and the layers of the convex hull; \
FindInfraQuadric stays on the Experimental guide\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"9a9b2fc3-8e77-4094-b482-66a3373792b8"],

Cell["\<\
not here: an invariant of four points, the inverse of every head (the values \
of its unknowns for a given vertex set), and the graph of a line or of an arc \
as an exported name; none is in an item yet\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"f51bb847-98b5-42eb-a8c3-678d08d3c213"],

Cell["\<\
not here: the interactive multi-construction stepper in the causal and \
branchial direction; it stays on the Experimental guide\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"92ad1a32-ba35-4c01-9dae-b6b050f9768b"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

